        {
          "step_id": "tile_stakeholder_tailoring_anticipating.s05",
          "type": "explainer",
          "concept_ids": [
            "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections"
          ],
          "eyebrow": "Anticipating Questions",
          "title": "Answering Questions Before They Are Asked",
          "lede": "Handing the operations manager a recommendation to add a Lagos courier is unlikely to be the end of the conversation.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "text": "An analyst should be prepared to respond to challenge from the approver, or scrutiny from project or programme boards, about their analysis. Being tailored to the audience means thinking about what questions they will ask, and answering these in the writing \u2014 so the Lagos report can note up front what else was ruled out (traffic patterns, order volume) before the manager has to ask.",
              "role": "mechanism",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#f1",
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#f3"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#tb1",
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#tb2"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "text": "Some technical or detail-oriented people prefer to understand the specifics of an analysis first, so they are prepared for ideas about next steps. Presenting findings before a request can, in that situation, avoid an audience derailing the presentation with a bunch of questions \u2014 showing the Lagos data before asking for budget approval can head off 'where's this number from' mid-request.",
              "role": "practical_context",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#f2"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.anticipating_questions_objections#tb3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "reward": {
            "gems": 2
