          "type": "explainer",
          "concept_ids": [
            "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing"
          ],
          "eyebrow": "Executive Summary",
          "title": "The Executive Summary: One Page That Must Stand Alone",
          "lede": "The full Lagos delivery-time presentation may never get read past its first page.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "text": "An executive summary is a one- or two-page overview of a much longer presentation, provided so the reader gets the main messages without reading the entire communication; it may be the only thing the audience ever looks at. The summary's title should state the main takeaway and set the tone for the rest of the page, and the summary should follow a narrative arc with an obvious beginning, middle, and end \u2014 a title like 'Lagos delivery times are slowing \u2014 recommend adding one courier' already tells a skimming reader the point before they read a word of the body.",
              "role": "definition",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#f1",
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#f2"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#tb1",
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#tb2",
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#tb3"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "text": "Content should be grouped into easily-discernible sections with text headers, so someone scanning for only a few seconds still understands the main points. Bullets should generally be avoided in favour of well-constructed sentences and mini-paragraphs, except when listing elements. A short 'Finding' section and a short 'Recommendation' section, each a sentence or two, serve a scanning reader better than a single unbroken paragraph.",
              "role": "workflow",
              "lineage": {
                "concept_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing"
                ],
                "fact_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#f3"
                ],
                "teaching_block_ids": [
                  "stakeholder.executive_summary_writing#tb4"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "before_after",
              "before": {
                "type": "diagram",
                "diagram_kind": "mapping",
                "title": "Before: unstructured paragraph",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "b_para",
                    "label": "Single unbroken paragraph: 'Lagos delivery times rose from 22 to 30 minutes in Month 2. Distance is the strongest driver (r=0.82). We recommend adding one courier on the longest routes. Traffic patterns and order volume were ruled out as primary causes. The analysis covered 20 orders across Lagos, Abuja, and Kano.'"
                  }
                ],
                "edges": [],
                "alt_text": "Before: one unbroken paragraph with no title, no section headers, mixing finding, recommendation, and method."
              },
              "after": {
                "type": "diagram",
                "diagram_kind": "mapping",
                "title": "After: structured executive summary",
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "id": "a_title",
                    "label": "Title: Lagos delivery times are slowing \u2014 recommend adding one courier"
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "a_finding",
                    "label": "Finding: Lagos average delivery time rose from 22 to 30 minutes in Month 2. Distance is the strongest driver of delivery time (r = 0.82)."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "a_rec",
                    "label": "Recommendation: Add one courier on the longest Lagos routes to bring average delivery time back below 25 minutes."
