                  }
                ],
                "alt_text": "After: executive summary with a takeaway title, a Finding section header, and a Recommendation section header \u2014 each a sentence or two of prose."
              },
              "change_summary": "Headers and a takeaway title replace the undifferentiated paragraph, letting a scanning reader find the finding and recommendation in seconds.",
