          "eyebrow": "Let's Revisit",
          "title": "Opening, Body, Call to Action \u2014 The Three Slots",
          "lede": "Every presentation has three jobs to do, in order.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "prose",
              "text": "The opening level-sets the audience: why are we looking at Lagos delivery times? The body presents the finding and the evidence: delivery times rose from 22 to 30 minutes in Month 2, and distance is the strongest driver. The call to action closes the presentation by stating what is being asked \u2014 approve adding one courier \u2014 only after the audience has the context needed to understand the request. Placing the call to action before the context leaves the audience without the 'why', making the request harder to evaluate.",
